\b Microsoft Agent Framework (MAF)\par
\b0 Microsoft Agent Framework (MAF) is an open-source framework from \b Microsoft\b0  for building, orchestrating, deploying, and managing \b AI agents\b0  and \b multi-agent systems\b0  in enterprise applications. It enables developers to create intelligent agents that can reason, use tools, access enterprise data, collaborate with other agents, and execute complex workflows.\par
The framework supports multiple programming languages, including \b Python\b0 , \b .NET\b0 , and \b Go (Preview)\b0 , and integrates with popular AI models such as \b Azure OpenAI\b0 , \b OpenAI\b0 , \b Anthropic Claude\b0 , \b Microsoft Foundry\b0 , and others.\par
